  <article class="card table-card"><div class="card-heading"><div><h3>Matched strategy results</h3><p class="card-subtitle">Identical measured dates within each regime comparison</p></div><button class="button button-quiet" data-action="export-path">${icon('download')} CSV</button></div><div id="strategyTable"></div><p class="table-footnote">Native-quote synthetic paths with a 5 bp hedge-turnover proxy. Annualization uses observed native intervals. Window filters retain original return/cost accounting. Highlighted examples were selected retrospectively.</p></article>
